>31 vii 9</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">(ii B. C.)</span>; <span class=\"gk\">π. χώρα,</span> Lat. <b class=\"lex-tr\">ager publicus,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Plb.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.45.3</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">παῖδες π.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">IG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">14.748</span> </span> (Naples); <span class=\"gk\">χορὸς π.</span> ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.1776</span> </span> (Helice); at Rome, <span class=\"gk\">π. στρατηγία</span> office of praetor <b class=\"lex-tr\">urbanus</b> (i. e. <b class=\"lex-tr\">qui inter cives ius dicit),</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Plu.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Brut.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7</span> </span>. <span class=\"lex-gram\">Adv.</span> <span class=\"gk\">-κῶς, κινεῖν</span> bring a <b class=\"lex-tr\">civil</b> action, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Cod.Just.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.20.13.1</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"4\"><span class=\"lex-n\">b</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">in a town,</b> <span class=\"gk\">π. τόπος</span> a <b class=\"lex-tr\">city</b> site, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">POxy.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2109.8</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">(iii A. D.)</span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"4\"><span class=\"lex-n\">c</span> <span class=\"gk\">πολιτικός, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ὁ</span>,</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">official,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">PTeb.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">208</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">(i B. C.)</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Sammelb.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">286</span> </span> (pl.), <span class=